<BaseLayout title="Website Privacy Information" description="Information about the OCA website's static hosting and its links to third-party forms.">
 <PageHero eyebrow="PRIVACY" title="Website privacy information" description="How this informational website is structured and where requests for appointments and insurance checks take place."/>
 <section class="section"><div class="container article-body"><h2>About this website</h2><p>This website is a static informational site. It does not collect medical histories, insurance IDs, dates of birth, or form submissions directly.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Appointment and insurance request links may open third-party forms operated outside this website. Please review the relevant form and confirm with OCA that it is the approved route for sensitive information before using it.</p><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>GitHub Pages, if enabled as the host, may record visitors' IP addresses for security and operation. External map and font services may process ordinary connection information when loaded.</p><h2>Medical or urgent matters</h2><p>Do not email private medical details to the general address. For emergencies, call 911.</p><p class="soft-note">This is technical website information, not a finalized practice privacy notice or HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices. The organization must supply and approve its formal notices before production launch.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
